WEBVTT

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:08.730
Butsumetsu City...

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:10.440
This is it.

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:12.060
It's gotta be.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.230
I can feel it,

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:17.280
somewhere in this city.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.200
Good morning, Sakura!

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.030
Good morning.

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:22.660
You're as gorgeous as ever today!

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:23.780
I know.

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:29.040
Good morning, Sakura!

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:14.440
Like I said,

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:18.820
I want to carefully consider my plan of attack.

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:23.910
The more you rush me, the less I want to do anything.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:25.200
The problem is,

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:29.540
if a god like you stays in the human world for too long,

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:32.170
there's a chance you could affect the energy balance yourself.

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:36.010
Then lemme just go out there guns blazing and get it done!

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:39.430
Trying to be subtle makes it really friggin' hard, you know?

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:41.140
You little...

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:44.720
Okay, fine.

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:51.060
As long as you don't let the humans realize who you are, you may exercise <i>some</i>—

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:53.480
Can I do her?!

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:55.780
What do you mean, "do?"

00:02:55.780 --> 00:03:00.490
Your goal is to reclaim Sakura Ichiko's Fortune, not—

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:03.280
Please insert more coins.

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:07.540
All right, let's do this.

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:12.290
Now then, we'll start with an introduction from our new transfer student.

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:14.040
What a pain.

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:14.750
Is this a joke?

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:18.340
Uh, good to meet you, everyone.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.930
I'm Hinkongawa Momiji.

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:23.090
Let's see...

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:25.890
my hobby is cosplaying, my favorite word is BDSM,

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:27.430
and my special skill is deadpan humor.

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:29.390
Oh, yeah.

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:35.190
I hate suck-ups who are like, "Everything!" when you ask them what they like about their girlfriend.

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:37.570
Isn't she supposed to be a god?

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:39.570
Why the hell is she here as a transfer student?!

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:43.360
I'd describe my periods as "relatively light".
I like bodies that are—

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:44.870
Okay, that's enough.

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:47.700
By the way, are you sure that's how you pronounce your name?

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:49.540
Call me what you like.

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:52.830
All right, Binbouda. You can sit next to Sakura.

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:59.130
Nice to meet you, Sakura!

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:02.050
The pleasure's all mine, Binbouda!

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:04.930
By the way, I couldn't help but notice that your chest resembles a cliff.

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:07.430
What's with that? Are you paying respect to something?

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:10.180
A woman's chest is like a great, rolling pasture.

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:14.480
Yours is more like Gian trying to sing.
Huge, fat and embarrassing to look at.

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:25.660
Okay, stop right there.

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:32.790
<i>I can't believe that tramp actually transferred into my school.</i>

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:36.080
<i>She's just gonna make a grab for my Fortune the second I take my eyes off her.</i>

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:37.460
<i>I'd like to see her try.</i>

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:40.710
<i>You think I'll just let you do whatever the hell you want?</i>

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:43.380
I hate P.E.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:44.880
Seriously.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:46.220
<i>But more importantly...</i>

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:50.470
Go easy on me, okay?

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:53.520
How is she getting away with that outfit?!

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:57.060
Mai, don't hold back just cause she's new!

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:59.070
Of course not!

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:06.530
Oh, I'm so sorry!

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:09.200
Hisa! Hang in there!

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:11.870
It didn't hit you! You're fine!

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:14.500
Why that little...

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.120
Hey, boys!

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:20.840
Don't play around when lighting a spirit lamp!

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:28.800
What's wrong, Sakura?

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:33.060
Oh, nothing. The edge of my notebook just caught on fire a little.

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:38.400
<i>That's her all right.</i>

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:41.320
<i>As if I'd fall for this! It's the oldest trick in the book!</i>

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:48.990
Would it have killed you to just let that one go?

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:51.660
Yeah, actually, it would! Is that what you want?!

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:58.120
Calm down, Ichiko, calm down!

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:02.000
If I get sucked into her game,
I'll be playing right into her hands!

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:09.510
Dammit! Gotta resist the urge to look...
It's not like it's anything important!

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:12.260
But I'm so... curious...

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:18.690
C'mon, keep fuckin' with me! I dare you!

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:20.900
What's gotten into you, Sakura?

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:22.940
She's not her usual self today.

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:28.740
Looks like you've been unmasked.

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:34.990
<i>Ugh... I'm so tired.</i>

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:38.290
<i>Trying to stay calm's the least of my problems!</i>

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:44.750
<i>That bitch of a god, thinking she can do whatever the hell she wants!</i>

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.550
<i>And now the class is catching on!</i>

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:53.470
No! If this keeps up my reputation's gonna swirl down the toilet!

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:57.350
I have to think of a way to get rid of her.

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:05.360
I'm in-a trouble. I'm in-a real trouble.

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:09.110
I'm so hungry I can't take the other step.

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:11.320
What the hell?

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:14.700
Ah, it is the beautiful lady.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:17.200
Our meeting here must be the sign, you know?

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:19.750
Say what? Get the hell off my leg!

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.040
I'm a traveling priest.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:23.080
Could you be helping me out

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:26.460
and just let me stay at your place, get some food, take a bath, use your bathroom, and grab a toothbrush?

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:28.010
Just for one night?

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:29.130
You're asking a lot!

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:32.890
Your skin is the beautiful!

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:34.140
Get the fuck off me!

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:37.890
Goddamnit! What a fucking creep!

00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:43.310
Seriously, since that damn god showed up
it's been nothing but—

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:43.900
...Huh?

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:47.270
Where'd this mess come from?

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:50.570
I left all these clothes in the closet!

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:54.070
Don't be selfish! Just be happy with what you have.

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:56.120
That sounded like her.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:08:00.790
You can get used to living anywhere, you know. I'm sure you'll grow to like it in good time.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:03.210
Welcome back, Nobita!

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:06.670
Did you bring back some kind of cat from the future?!

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:07.460
Ah.

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:08.800
Huh.

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:17.300
Gadget of Misfortune:

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:19.220
The Pint-Sized Space Creator!

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:21.600
Capable of creating magical items out of thin air!

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:25.810
Okay, that was just my imagination!

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:27.190
That's all it was!

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:30.900
Launch! Light barrage!

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:36.200
One thousand five hundred and one, one thousand five hundred—

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:38.990
No! Don't look!

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:45.540
Hey, were you born in a tent?! Knock before you open the door, you jerk!

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:53.670
Dammit, Ichiko, this is no laughing matter!

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:55.680
Get a grip, get a grip.

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:57.260
I gotta calm down and think of a way to—

00:08:57.260 --> 00:08:59.350
Oh, Mama!

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:04.270
It smells just like my Mama did!

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:04.850
Clear and Serene
Clear and Serene

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:08.770
Clear and serene.
Clear and Serene
Clear and Serene

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:11.440
Clear and serene kick!

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:15.150
What the hell do you think you're doing, you freak?!

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:18.910
Are you with that closet-squatting hobo, too?!

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:24.500
Wait! I saw you chased by something inhuman! Am I not the wrong?

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:29.210
I can help you!

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:35.090
So you're Sakura Ichiko. A good name.

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:40.930
My name is Bobby. I've been traveling all around the country, banishing evil spirits.

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:42.520
<i>How many of those are you gonna eat?</i>

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:47.980
I came to this city because I saw a great amount of negative energy emanating from it.

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:50.190
After our chance meeting,

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:55.190
I couldn't help but notice that you were being pursued by the source of this energy. Thus, I followed you here.

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:57.910
Wait a minute! Since when can you talk normally?!

00:09:57.910 --> 00:09:59.160
Oh, that?

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:01.280
My Mama always used to tell me,

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:05.370
"Just act like a foreigner in trouble, and those Japanese folk'll treat you right!"

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:08.040
I'm gonna teach your Mama a lesson!

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:11.460
But this is a God of Misfortune, not an evil spirit.

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:12.920
You got the wrong religion, buddy.

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:14.380
Don't worry about that.

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:16.670
With the merging of Shinto and Buddhism,

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:19.260
the Sun God Amaterasu and the
Mahavairocana Tathagata became one,

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:22.140
as did the War God Hachiman and the Amitabha Tathagata.

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:26.680
Japan began to think of the Shinto gods and the
various Buddhas as being equivalent to each other.

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:32.270
In the country of gods, there is no absolute religion.

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:33.110
Then—

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:39.070
That said, you may possess a greater talent for exorcism than I.

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:40.660
What do you mean?

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:46.910
As I said before, I came to this city because I sensed a great abundance of negative energy.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:53.170
Now I realize that the source of that energy is the
flat-chested woman you call a "God of Misfortune".

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:54.750
You wanna die?!

00:10:54.750 --> 00:11:01.550
However, Sakura Ichiko, you possess a powerful energy of your own that rivals the God of Misfortune in strength.

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:05.100
Are you able to see Fortune?

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:08.060
My spiritual sense is hella strong, babe!

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:13.480
I can't quite tell where your Fortune is concentrated, but I think it's somewhere around here...

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:16.070
Oh yeah, baby!

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:20.740
That was just a joke! A joke!

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:23.870
Like, my hand was moving on its own!

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:26.290
C'mon, say something! Anything!

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:28.000
You look like you've totally snapped!

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:30.920
You look like you're seriously gonna kill me!

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:35.000
You fuckin' think so, you perverted shitheel of a priest?!

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:39.260
So? Are you actually capable of anything besides sexual assault?

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:41.720
T-Take this.

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:43.140
Huh?

00:11:45.050 --> 00:11:45.890
What is it?

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:51.440
It's a powerful holy device created by me: the Soumin Shourai!

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:58.820
The Soumin Shourai, blessed with the power of Susano-o, is capable of curing epidemics and preventing calamities.

00:11:58.820 --> 00:12:04.410
Your spiritual power far exceeds my own, so in your hands the Soumin Shourai should be able to achieve its true potential!

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:08.660
Wow... I see.

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:14.170
And by wearing these, you'll be able to increase your spiritual output even further!

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:14.830
Clothes?

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:17.340
These are no regular clothes.

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:20.380
These are special priestess robes that connect you to the gods!

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:21.420
Priestess?

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:27.680
That actually sounds pretty cool!

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:30.850
Oh, I made some modifications.

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:41.650
The hell is this?

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:43.030
They're kinda tight.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:48.990
It was worth every minute of the three
all-nighters those took to put together.

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:51.290
You're just making this shit up, aren't you?!

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:54.710
Our preparations are complete! Now go, Sakura Ichiko!

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:04.260
It feels like the "God vs. Girl" fight has just begun!

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:06.340
What's up with this cliffhanger manga page?!

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:08.350
It's leading into the commercial break.

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:09.720
What, already?!

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:37.830
Hey, which one did you like best?

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:47.010
Cute!

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:51.010
Skirt's a bit short.

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:53.890
Oh, this isn't bad.

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:56.940
Hey, which one did you like best?

00:13:58.060 --> 00:13:58.900
Oh.

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:06.990
Show yourself, God of Misfortune!

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:09.780
Let's settle this, here and now!

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:15.040
Christ, you're noisy. What time do you think it—

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:22.170
Y-You're wearing... that outfit...

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:26.260
She's not taking this seriously!

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:27.300
Sorry. I couldn't help it.

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:30.800
Young'un! If you're gonna cosplay, you gotta steel yourself against these reactions!

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:33.720
Who the hell am I supposed to be?!

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:36.480
All right! Watch the birdie!

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:39.560
Hey! Who said you could take pictures?!

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:42.230
I've made up my mind! I'm joining the Newspaper Club!

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:45.190
Like hell you are!

00:14:45.190 --> 00:14:46.780
Thanks for the scoop!

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:50.700
And here I was, wondering why you were acting so tough.

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:55.620
Did you really think you could beat me with just the Soumin Shourai?

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:57.370
How did she know?

00:14:57.370 --> 00:15:00.040
It's not that surprising when you think about it.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:01.170
She <i>is</i> a god, after all.

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:03.670
More importantly, though...

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:06.880
What a perfect shot!

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:11.220
I wonder what the boys in the class will think when they see this!

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:16.060
You think I'm just doing this for shits and giggles?!

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:20.940
If you weren't here, none of this would've happened!

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:26.780
You're gonna get the hell out of my life... Starting now!

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:31.950
There's no doubt! She's done it!

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:40.040
Wh-What is that?

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:43.540
Amazing!

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:48.880
I knew she wasn't normal, but this is ridiculous.

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:50.550
What an annoying brat.

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:53.510
It's time to face the music, God of Misfortune!

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:01.730
Damn it! I worked so hard for that exclusive!

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:11.700
<i>These things might look playful, but they're sure as hell not playin' around!</i>

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:14.030
<i>Is this Ichiko's true nature?</i>

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:18.870
Careful now.

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:24.080
You're not getting away! After her!

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:28.670
Come on, this isn't even an action show.

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:35.050
All right! We got her now!

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:39.010
Why, you...

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:44.140
Take this! And this!

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:46.060
My love, my anger, and all of my sorrow!

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:48.770
Die quietly, punk!

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:50.650
I'm a god, for Christ's sake!

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:52.240
Enough with this bullshit!

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:56.950
Damn!

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:00.740
Geez, how annoying.

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:05.120
But that's how it goes.

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:09.420
You're not getting out of this one no matter how much you beg.

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:13.670
Wh-What is this?

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:16.930
Manifestation.

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:21.810
Did you really think there was anything you could do that I couldn't?

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:29.520
Go forth!

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:33.860
Let her taste the cursed power of a God of Misfortune!

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:35.820
Bring it!

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:37.860
I'll face you head on!

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:45.750
Excuse me?

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:51.210
Well, she did say to "go forth," but what do you think?

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:53.380
Man, I feel stiffer than a corpse!

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:56.550
Hey guys, you listening?

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:58.510
Just pretend you can't hear her.

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:00.930
Don't call us out for crap like this, man.

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:03.100
Yo, let's watch some TV.

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:04.390
Care to explain?

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:05.810
Well, basically...

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:14.230
Since I'm so lazy, and these guys were born from my own Misfortune, it's only natural that they'd be lazy-ass bums as well.

00:18:14.230 --> 00:18:15.860
That's just how it is.

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:19.200
Oh? I see.

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:23.200
Time out!

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:29.460
I... I did it!

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.590
I won!

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:34.590
It cost me a lot to get here, but...

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:38.090
Eat shit, God of Misfortune!

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:44.100
I guess I'm nothing more than a distant memory...

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:49.900
Is that so?

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:55.690
So you couldn't beat her even when you went all out?

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:59.530
I understand, Momiji. Let's regroup.

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:01.950
Return to Fort Mis.

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:07.200
Sorry. Could you give me a little more time to sort things out on my own?

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:08.250
But...

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:09.870
I...

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:13.170
Even I...

00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:18.260
...have some goddamn pride, okay? Get it?!

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:22.140
What was that?

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:24.600
Since when did she care so much?

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:30.980
Let's revise our strategy tomorrow.

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:35.400
Thank ye kindly once again.

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:40.700
<i>So you couldn't beat her even when you went all out?</i>

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:41.950
That little girl...

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:45.280
I've never been so disgraced!

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:48.040
I'm going to fucking ruin you!

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:50.750
Just watch me!

00:19:55.960 --> 00:20:00.340
I'm glad to be rid of that obnoxious bum at least, but...

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:03.340
somehow this place is even worse than before!

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:04.220
You talkin' to me?

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:06.300
Can't you <i>do</i> something about this?!

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:08.350
It's a little beyond my area of expertise.

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:12.020
Excuse me, can I put this beer in the fridge?

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:14.730
Goddamn it! Don't touch anything!

00:20:15.310 --> 00:20:16.150
I'm back.

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:18.480
What the fuck are you doing here?!

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:22.110
Don't "I'm back" me!

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:07.090
Teddy, I just thought of a way we can catch Ichiko off guard.

00:22:07.430 --> 00:22:13.010
That wretched girl is actually pretty innocent.

00:22:13.350 --> 00:22:15.310
Hey, Ichiko! Did you know?

00:22:15.310 --> 00:22:16.100
Huh?

00:22:16.640 --> 00:22:21.770
You know, babies aren't actually brought by a stork.

00:22:30.280 --> 00:22:35.250
Since this is a one-cour show, we can't just sit around waiting to be watched then forgotten.

00:22:35.250 --> 00:22:40.000
To that end, I came up with some merchandise that'll boost our popularity.

00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:41.380
Oh?

00:22:42.210 --> 00:22:43.670
How's this?

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:47.590
It's the Sakura Ichiko mouse<i>rack</i>.

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:49.880
Huh? Isn't that a bit cliché?

00:22:50.720 --> 00:22:52.640
Here's something a bit more original.

00:22:53.510 --> 00:22:57.520
The first of its kind: the Momiji mousepad! Completely to scale!

00:22:58.980 --> 00:23:02.900
Hey, that just looks like a normal mousepad!

00:23:05.900 --> 00:23:08.650
You're gonna pay for that!

00:23:08.650 --> 00:23:11.030
Hey, you laughed too!

00:23:11.950 --> 00:23:15.040
This week's <i>Nadeshiko ga!</i>

00:23:15.040 --> 00:23:17.830
Thanks for waiting, everyone!

00:23:17.830 --> 00:23:21.920
This week was another resounding success!

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:23.750
Without further ado, once more...

00:23:24.710 --> 00:23:26.090
And again!

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:29.920
Double the Nadeshiko, double the fun!
Who knows what's in store?

00:23:29.920 --> 00:23:32.510
It's just fabulous!
